{"id":62331,"mal_id":62331,"title":"Liar Game","englishTitle":"Liar Game","title_english":"Liar Game","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Liar Game","ja":"LIAR GAME"},"synopsis":"Nao Kanzaki is honest to a fault. Uncorrupted and virtuous, Nao is the perfect target for a large-scale scheme—the so-called Liar Game. Suddenly in possession of one hundred million yen, she is expected to steal the same amount from her assigned opponent—her former middle school teacher—or face crushing debt. Trusting her teacher without question, Nao quickly realizes that she is trapped.\n\nTo gain an advantage, Nao comes in contact with Shinichi Akiyama, a brilliant con artist just released from prison. Though Akiyama has no real reason to help the naive girl, he ends up aiding her victory. However, driven by her unwavering sense of justice, Nao chooses to continue into the next round, and Akiyama, unwilling to leave her to fail, joins her. In the Liar Game, participants are expected and required to deceive, manipulate, and betray or be buried in lifelong debt. Yet Nao, with the help of Akiyama's genius, is determined to beat the game without abandoning her morals and prove that generosity and sincerity will always prevail.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Nao Kanzaki es extremadamente honesto. Incorrupta y virtuosa, Nao es el objetivo perfecto para un plan a gran escala: el llamado Juego del Mentiroso. De repente, en posesión de cien millones de yenes, se espera que le robe la misma cantidad a su oponente asignado (su antiguo profesor de secundaria) o se enfrente a una deuda abrumadora. Al confiar en su maestra sin lugar a dudas, Nao rápidamente se da cuenta de que está atrapada.\n\nPara obtener ventaja, Nao entra en contacto con Shinichi Akiyama, un brillante estafador que acaba de salir de prisión. Aunque Akiyama no tiene ninguna razón real para ayudar a la ingenua chica, termina contribuyendo a su victoria. Sin embargo, impulsada por su inquebrantable sentido de la justicia, Nao decide continuar en la siguiente ronda y Akiyama, que no está dispuesto a dejarla fracasar, se une a ella. En el Juego del Mentiroso, se espera y se exige que los participantes engañen, manipulen y traicionen o queden enterrados en deudas de por vida. Sin embargo, Nao, con la ayuda del genio de Akiyama, está decidida a ganar el juego sin abandonar su moral y demostrar que la generosidad y la sinceridad siempre prevalecerán.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1430,"average_episode_duration":1430,"startDate":"2026-04-07","start_date":"2026-04-07","endDate":"2026-09-29","end_date":"2026-09-29","season":"spring","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"spring"},"episodes":26,"num_episodes":26,"score":6.89,"mean":6.89,"numListUsers":82242,"num_list_users":82242,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":59,"name":"High Stakes Game"},{"id":40,"name":"Psychological"},{"id":42,"name":"Seinen"},{"id":11,"name":"Strategy Game"},{"id":41,"name":"Suspense"}],"studios":[{"id":11,"name":"Madhouse"}],"pictures":["https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1804/151666l.webp","https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1248/154445l.webp","https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1411/154479l.webp","https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1607/156078l.webp","https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1462/156100l.webp","https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1984/158634l.webp"],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/Ag6VnSAb1g02YWHYxYFKRUiBtnc.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n6hjDin7PkTHgEVU5uY5fxgh84o.png","tmdb_id":"300126","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:39:19.449Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1984/158634.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1984/158634l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1984/158634.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/ima